{"dialogue": {"lines": [{"en": "Welcome! I'm Rahul, your manager.", "hi": "सुस्वागतम्! मैं राहुल, आपका मैनेजर।", "r": "Sushagotom! Ami Rahul, apnar myanejar.", "sp": "Manager", "t": "সুস্বাগতম! আমি রাহুল, আপনার ম্যানেজার।"}, {"en": "Hello! I'm Priya. Today is my first day.", "hi": "नमस्कार! मैं प्रिया। आज मेरा पहला दिन है।", "r": "Nomoshkar! Ami Priya. Aj amar prothom din.", "sp": "You", "t": "নমস্কার! আমি প্রিয়া। আজ আমার প্রথম দিন।"}, {"en": "Your desk is over there. The computer is on.", "hi": "आपकी डेस्क उधर है। कंप्यूटर चालू है।", "r": "Apnar desk oidike. Kompiuṭar chalu achhe.", "sp": "Manager", "t": "আপনার ডেস্ক ওইদিকে। কম্পিউটার চালু আছে।"}, {"en": "What time is the meeting?", "hi": "मीटिंग कितने बजे है?", "r": "Miṭing koyṭay?", "sp": "You", "t": "মিটিং কয়টায়?"}, {"en": "At ten in the morning. Have some tea first.", "hi": "सुबह दस बजे। पहले चाय पी लीजिए।", "r": "Shokal doshṭay. Age cha kheye nin.", "sp": "Manager", "t": "সকাল দশটায়। আগে চা খেয়ে নিন।"}, {"en": "Thank you very much!", "hi": "बहुत धन्यवाद!", "r": "Onek dhonnobad!", "sp": "You", "t": "অনেক ধন্যবাদ!"}], "title": "First day at the office"}, "lede": "Jobs, offices, meetings and money — the Bengali of working life.", "phrases": [{"en": "I work in an office", "hi": "मैं ऑफ़िस में काम करता हूँ", "r": "Ami office kaj kori", "t": "আমি অফিসে কাজ করি"}, {"en": "What time is the meeting?", "hi": "मीटिंग कितने बजे है?", "r": "Miṭing koyṭay?", "t": "মিটিং কয়টায়?"}, {"en": "Please sign here", "hi": "कृपया यहाँ हस्ताक्षर कीजिए", "r": "Doya kore ekhane soi korun", "t": "দয়া করে এখানে সই করুন"}, {"en": "I will send the email today", "hi": "मैं आज ईमेल भेजूँगा", "r": "Ami aj imeil paṭhabo", "t": "আমি আজ ইমেইল পাঠাবো"}, {"en": "The deadline is Friday", "hi": "डेडलाइन शुक्रवार है", "r": "Shomoyshima shukrobar", "t": "সময়সীমা শুক্রবার"}, {"en": "I am late today", "hi": "आज मुझे देर हो गयी", "r": "Aj amar deri hoye gechhe", "t": "আজ আমার দেরি হয়ে গেছে"}, {"en": "Take a lunch break", "hi": "लंच ब्रेक लीजिए", "r": "Dupurer biroti nin", "t": "দুপুরের বিরতি নিন"}, {"en": "Good work, well done", "hi": "अच्छा काम, शाबाश", "r": "Bhalo kaj, shabash", "t": "ভালো কাজ, সাবাশ"}, {"en": "See you tomorrow", "hi": "कल मिलेंगे", "r": "Kal dekha hobe", "t": "কাল দেখা হবে"}, {"en": "Where is the manager?", "hi": "मैनेजर कहाँ हैं?", "r": "Myanejar kothay?", "t": "ম্যানেজার কোথায়?"}, {"en": "I need leave tomorrow", "hi": "मुझे कल छुट्टी चाहिए", "r": "Amar kal chhuṭi dorkar", "t": "আমার কাল ছুটি দরকার"}, {"en": "The printer is not working", "hi": "प्रिंटर काम नहीं कर रहा", "r": "Prinṭar kaj korchhe na", "t": "প্রিন্টার কাজ করছে না"}], "quiz": [{"a": "salary", "explain": "বেতন (beton) = salary — মজুরি is daily wages.", "id": "bq-35", "lesson": "office", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["salary", "bonus", "leave", "meeting"], "q": "বেতন means…", "topic": "office", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "মিটিং", "explain": "মিটিং (miṭing) = meeting — মিটিং কয়টায়? (what time is the meeting?)", "id": "bq-36", "lesson": "office", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["মিটিং", "ছুটি", "বেতন", "খবর"], "q": "Which is 'meeting'?", "topic": "office", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "I work in an office", "explain": "আমি অফিসে কাজ করি — অফিসে = in the office.", "id": "bq-37", "lesson": "office", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["I work in an office", "I go to the office", "I need leave", "I am the manager"], "q": "'আমি অফিসে কাজ করি' means…", "topic": "office", "type": "meaning"}, {"a": "আমার কাল ছুটি দরকার", "explain": "আমার কাল ছুটি দরকার = I need leave tomorrow. ছুটি = leave.", "id": "bq-38", "lesson": "office", "level": "elementary", "opts": ["আমার কাল ছুটি দরকার", "আমার বেতন চাই", "মিটিং কয়টায়?", "প্রিন্টার দিন"], "q": "Ask for leave tomorrow. You say…", "topic": "office", "type": "usage"}, {"a": "signature", "explain": "সই (soi) = signature — এখানে সই করুন (sign here).", "id": "bq-39", "lesson": "office", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["signature", "stamp", "file", "notice"], "q": "সই means…", "topic": "office", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "deadline", "explain": "সময়সীমা (shomoyshima) = deadline — লক্ষ্য is the target.", "id": "bq-40", "lesson": "office", "level": "elementary", "opts": ["deadline", "target", "plan", "report"], "q": "সময়সীমা means…", "topic": "office", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "the printer is not working", "explain": "প্রিন্টার কাজ করছে না — করছে না = is not doing.", "id": "bq-41", "lesson": "office", "level": "elementary", "opts": ["the printer is not working", "the printer is new", "print this paper", "the computer is on"], "q": "'প্রিন্টার কাজ করছে না' means…", "topic": "office", "type": "meaning"}, {"a": "সকাল দশটায়", "explain": "সকাল দশটায় = at ten in the morning.", "id": "bq-42", "lesson": "office", "level": "elementary", "opts": ["সকাল দশটায়", "কাল ছুটি", "বেতন পেয়েছি", "চা খাবো"], "q": "Reply 'at ten in the morning'. You say…", "topic": "office", "type": "usage"}, {"a": "colleague", "explain": "সহকর্মী (shohokormi) = colleague — সহ = co-, কর্মী = worker.", "id": "bq-43", "lesson": "office", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["colleague", "manager", "guard", "driver"], "q": "সহকর্মী means…", "topic": "office", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "see you tomorrow", "explain": "কাল দেখা হবে — literally 'tomorrow meeting will happen'.", "id": "bq-44", "lesson": "office", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["see you tomorrow", "good morning", "take care", "well done"], "q": "'কাল দেখা হবে' means…", "topic": "office", "type": "meaning"}], "slug": "office", "title": "Office & work", "words": [{"en": "office", "hi": "ऑफ़िस", "r": "ophish", "t": "অফিস"}, {"en": "company", "hi": "कंपनी", "r": "kompani", "t": "কোম্পানি"}, {"en": "department", "hi": "विभाग", "r": "bibhag", "t": "বিভাগ"}, {"en": "branch", "hi": "शाखा", "r": "shakha", "t": "শাখা"}, {"en": "head office", "hi": "प्रधान कार्यालय", "r": "prodhan karjaloy", "t": "প্রধান কার্যালয়"}, {"en": "boss", "hi": "बॉस", "r": "bosh", "t": "বস"}, {"en": "manager", "hi": "मैनेजर", "r": "myanejar", "t": "ম্যানেজার"}, {"en": "colleague", "hi": "सहकर्मी